'''Premium Fair''' (プレミアムフェア, ''Puremiamu Fea'', '''Premium Fair''') is a seasonal event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

==Event Information==
The Premium Fair event is on now with huge sales!

On from<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''June 1 until June 19, 2026 (10:59 AM)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Earn Cat Food every week from the Cat Scratcher Lottery!'''}}<br>
Earn Cat Food every week from the Cat Scratcher Lottery!<br>
Earn Cat Food depending on the space you choose!

On from<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''・June 1 (11:00 AM) until June 7 (11:59 PM)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''・June 8 (11:00 AM) until June 14 (11:59 PM)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''・June 15 (11:00 AM) until June 19 (10:59 AM)'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Platinum Ticket Double Sale on now!'''}}<br>
