※Platinum Double Sale, Part 2 will become available 7 days after purchasing Platinum Double Sale, Part 1.<br>
※Platinum Sale Part 1 and Part 2 each can only be purchased once per account.<br>
※Seasonal characters, collab characters, limited Girls & Monsters characters, and other limited Rare Capsule characters are not available from Platinum Capsules.

